# game/scenario/6_1_0.rpy:37
translate english 066a130b:

    # think "Je me réveille avant l'annonce du matin. Pas besoin de Kami, cette fois."
    think "I wake up before the morning announcement. No need for Kami this time."

# game/scenario/6_1_0.rpy:38
translate english f4980840:

    # think "Le vote suffit à m'empêcher de dormir correctement."
    think "The vote is enough to keep me from sleeping properly."

# game/scenario/6_1_0.rpy:42
translate english 5bbfcb74:

    # think "Dans quelques heures, nous devrons décider si les habitants peuvent franchir les frontières entre les districts."
    think "In a few hours, we'll have to decide whether people can cross the borders between districts."

# game/scenario/6_1_0.rpy:43
translate english ede13c1e:

    # think "Enfin... décider est un bien grand mot."
    think "Then again... 'decide' might be overstating it."

# game/scenario/6_1_0.rpy:44
translate english 559b98fb:

    # think "Sael a annoncé qu'elle voterait contre. Elle n'a laissé aucune place au doute."
    think "Sael said she'd vote against it. She left no room for doubt."

# game/scenario/6_1_0.rpy:45
translate english f7063e1a:

    # think "Une seule voix suffit. Le vote est déjà condamné, mais nous allons quand même devoir nous asseoir, débattre et faire semblant d'ignorer le résultat."
    think "One vote is all it takes. The proposal is already doomed, but we'll still have to sit down, debate, and pretend we don't know how it ends."

# game/scenario/6_1_0.rpy:49
translate english e76a6adc:

    # think "Hier encore, nous avons fêté le retour du commerce et la fin des bons de rationnement."
    think "Just yesterday, we celebrated the return of trade and the end of ration coupons."

# game/scenario/6_1_0.rpy:50
translate english 2739b791:

    # think "Les marchandises peuvent de nouveau circuler. Les gens, eux, resteront derrière leurs frontières."
    think "Goods can move freely again. People, on the other hand, will stay behind their borders."

# game/scenario/6_1_0.rpy:54
translate english fe852f83:

    # think "Je me lève. Rester ici ne rendra pas la journée plus courte."
    think "I get up. Staying here won't make the day go any faster."

# game/scenario/6_1_0.rpy:60
translate english cf18d924:

    # think "Je m'habille rapidement et quitte ma chambre pour rejoindre la cafétéria."
    think "I get dressed quickly and leave my room for the cafeteria."

# game/scenario/6_1_0.rpy:85
translate english b657326c:

    # think "Tout le monde est déjà là. Pourtant, personne ne parle vraiment."
    think "Everyone is already here. And yet, no one's really talking."

# game/scenario/6_1_0.rpy:86
translate english de849780:

    # think "Les couverts heurtent les assiettes. Les chaises grincent. Chaque bruit paraît plus fort que nécessaire."
    think "Cutlery clinks against plates. Chairs scrape across the floor. Every sound seems louder than it should."

# game/scenario/6_1_0.rpy:87
translate english fd65d3fb:

    # think "Ryn garde les yeux sur son plateau. Sael mange lentement, sans jamais regarder dans sa direction."
    think "Ryn keeps his eyes on his tray. Sael eats slowly, never once looking his way."

# game/scenario/6_1_0.rpy:91
translate english a6fac89a:

    # goumi "Bon ! Puisque personne ne semble décidé à rendre ce petit déjeuner vivant, je vais m'en charger."
    goumi "All right! Since no one else seems willing to liven up breakfast, I'll do it myself."

# game/scenario/6_1_0.rpy:92
translate english ee9a71de:

    # goumi "Grâce au rétablissement du commerce, de nouveaux produits vont arriver dès les prochaines livraisons."
    goumi "Now that trade has been restored, we'll start getting new products with the next few deliveries."

# game/scenario/6_1_0.rpy:93
translate english 57dfc231:

    # goumi "Des fruits frais, du cacao, du café, plusieurs épices et même quelques produits dont j'avais oublié l'existence."
    goumi "Fresh fruit, cocoa, coffee, several spices, and even a few things I'd forgotten existed."

# game/scenario/6_1_0.rpy:95
translate english c8894539:

    # elen joie "Attends, attends... du vrai cacao ? Pas la poudre triste qui colle au fond des tasses ?"
    elen joie "Wait, wait... real cocoa? Not that sad powder that sticks to the bottom of the cup?"

# game/scenario/6_1_0.rpy:97
translate english f1b798c8:

    # goumi "Du vrai cacao. Et si les quantités suivent, je pourrai même refaire certains desserts."
    goumi "Real cocoa. And if we get enough of it, I might even be able to make some desserts again."

# game/scenario/6_1_0.rpy:99
translate english 372f4387:

    # elen content "On a réussi ! Voilà ! C'est ça, le progrès !"
    elen content "We did it! See? Now that's progress!"

# game/scenario/6_1_0.rpy:100
translate english 354244ed:

    # elen joie "Je retire tout ce que j'ai pu dire de méchant sur le Conclave. Enfin, pas tout. Mais une partie raisonnable !"
    elen joie "I take back every bad thing I've ever said about the Conclave. Well, not everything. But a reasonable amount!"

# game/scenario/6_1_0.rpy:102
translate english 625e874c:

    # iris taquin "Tu viens officiellement de vendre tes convictions pour un gâteau au chocolat."
    iris taquin "You have officially sold out your principles for a chocolate cake."

# game/scenario/6_1_0.rpy:104
translate english 20d509bf:

    # elen content "Je ne les ai pas vendues. Je les ai échangées contre quelque chose de meilleur. C'est très différent."
    elen content "I didn't sell them. I traded them for something better. Totally different."

# game/scenario/6_1_0.rpy:106
translate english c6946df0:

    # julian sourire "La libre circulation des marchandises trouve déjà sa première grande défenseuse."
    julian sourire "The free movement of goods has already found its first great champion."

# game/scenario/6_1_0.rpy:108
translate english b5f1f8dd:

    # elen joie "Exactement ! Et demain je défendrai le café. Et après-demain les épices. Je suis très engagée politiquement."
    elen joie "Exactly! Tomorrow I'll fight for coffee. The day after that, spices. I'm very politically engaged."

# game/scenario/6_1_0.rpy:110
translate english 58acaef0:

    # mara taquin "Une vision solide. On sent les années de réflexion."
    mara taquin "A solid platform. You can tell it took years of careful thought."

# game/scenario/6_1_0.rpy:112
translate english 64cc4415:

    # elen taquin "Moque-toi. Tu viendras pleurer quand Goumi refusera de te donner une deuxième part."
    elen taquin "Laugh all you want. You'll come crying to me when Goumi refuses to give you a second slice."

# game/scenario/6_1_0.rpy:116
translate english f6b09ae2:

    # think "Quelques sourires apparaissent autour de la table. Même Sael relève brièvement les yeux."
    think "A few smiles appear around the table. Even Sael briefly looks up."

# game/scenario/6_1_0.rpy:117
translate english ebf99e15:

    # think "Puis le silence revient. Il suffit que l'un de nous regarde Ryn pour que tout le monde se souvienne de ce qui nous attend."
    think "Then the silence returns. All it takes is one of us looking at Ryn for everyone to remember what's coming."

# game/scenario/6_1_0.rpy:119
translate english 1a80e542:

    # tomas hesitation "La livraison est prévue pour quand ?"
    tomas hesitation "When is the delivery scheduled?"

# game/scenario/6_1_0.rpy:121
translate english f59e942a:

    # goumi "Demain matin, normalement. Une capsule complète. Nourriture, médicaments, matériel et quelques commandes particulières."
    goumi "Tomorrow morning, normally. A full capsule. Food, medicine, equipment, and a few special orders."

# game/scenario/6_1_0.rpy:123
translate english 67898266:

    # tomas neutre "D'accord. C'est... c'est une bonne nouvelle."
    tomas neutre "Okay. That's... that's good news."

# game/scenario/6_1_0.rpy:125
translate english 35bdabcb:

    # lysa blase "Oui. Une excellente nouvelle."
    lysa blase "Yes. Wonderful news."

# game/scenario/6_1_0.rpy:129
translate english df644395:

    # think "Personne n'ajoute que cette capsule traversera plusieurs frontières sans avoir à demander la permission."
    think "No one points out that the capsule will cross several borders without having to ask permission."

# game/scenario/6_1_0.rpy:130
translate english 2616b3f0:

    # think "Personne ne demande pourquoi une caisse de cacao dispose d'une liberté que des millions de personnes n'ont pas."
    think "No one asks why a crate of cocoa has a freedom millions of people don't."

# game/scenario/6_1_0.rpy:132
translate english d213c885:

    # elias ecoute "Ça va nous changer des mêmes plats tous les jours. C'est déjà pas mal."
    elias ecoute "It'll be a nice change from eating the same meals every day. That's something, at least."

# game/scenario/6_1_0.rpy:134
translate english 36ec2c51:

    # kael calme "Et les médicaments supplémentaires seront utiles. Les stocks de l'infirmerie ne sont pas inépuisables."
    kael calme "And the extra medicine will be useful. The infirmary's supplies won't last forever."

# game/scenario/6_1_0.rpy:136
translate english b5900825:

    # iris sourire "Pour une fois, je suis d'accord. Tout ce qui évite à Goumi de nous servir une nouvelle purée grise mérite d'être célébré."
    iris sourire "For once, I agree. Anything that keeps Goumi from serving us more gray mush deserves to be celebrated."

# game/scenario/6_1_0.rpy:138
translate english 1af49c76:

    # goumi "Je vous entends, vous savez."
    goumi "I can hear you, you know."

# game/scenario/6_1_0.rpy:140
translate english 27a11c5e:

    # iris taquin "C'était le but."
    iris taquin "That was the point."

# game/scenario/6_1_0.rpy:142
translate english 2b43c884:

    # elen rire "Ah ! Je savais que ce petit déjeuner finirait bien !"
    elen rire "Ha! I knew this breakfast would turn out all right!"

# game/scenario/6_1_0.rpy:146
translate english 685f147a:

    # think "Elen continue d'énumérer tout ce qu'elle voudrait manger. Julian l'aide à inventer des desserts impossibles."
    think "Elen keeps listing everything she wants to eat. Julian helps her invent impossible desserts."

# game/scenario/6_1_0.rpy:147
translate english 36935223:

    # think "Les autres les écoutent ou font semblant. C'est plus facile que de parler du vote."
    think "The others listen, or pretend to. It's easier than talking about the vote."

# game/scenario/6_1_0.rpy:149
translate english 732b72d6:

    # noam hesitation "Vous avez tous bien dormi ?"
    noam hesitation "Did everyone sleep okay?"

# game/scenario/6_1_0.rpy:151
translate english 4dba9c77:

    # nyra taquin "Tentative admirable. Transition catastrophique."
    nyra taquin "Admirable attempt. Catastrophic transition."

# game/scenario/6_1_0.rpy:153
translate english 6de3317e:

    # noam sourire "Je fais ce que je peux."
    noam sourire "I'm doing my best."

# game/scenario/6_1_0.rpy:155
translate english b7b522f2:

    # mara mefiant "On le voit."
    mara mefiant "We can tell."

# game/scenario/6_1_0.rpy:159
translate english a9aa6059:

    # ryn fatigue "J'ai pas dormi."
    ryn fatigue "Didn't sleep."

# game/scenario/6_1_0.rpy:161
translate english fb85b3d2:

    # think "Sa voix coupe la conversation. Sael s'immobilise une seconde, puis reprend son repas."
    think "His voice cuts through the conversation. Sael freezes for a second, then goes back to eating."

# game/scenario/6_1_0.rpy:163
translate english 74615769:

    # noam inquiet "Ryn..."
    noam inquiet "Ryn..."

# game/scenario/6_1_0.rpy:165
translate english 7842ef1c:

    # ryn desaccord "Quoi ? Il a posé une question. Je réponds."
    ryn desaccord "What? He asked a question. I answered."

# game/scenario/6_1_0.rpy:167
translate english 7ec04da9:

    # sael neutre "Personne ne te le reproche."
    sael neutre "No one's blaming you for it."

# game/scenario/6_1_0.rpy:169
translate english bdc5c7ee:

    # ryn colere "J'ai pas dit que quelqu'un me le reprochait."
    ryn colere "I didn't say anyone was."

# game/scenario/6_1_0.rpy:173
translate english ae7a75d5:

    # think "Le silence devient plus lourd encore. Elen baisse les yeux vers son assiette."
    think "The silence grows even heavier. Elen lowers her eyes to her plate."

# game/scenario/6_1_0.rpy:175
translate english 6828edfe:

    # lysa blase "On pourrait peut-être finir de manger sans commencer maintenant."
    lysa blase "Maybe we could finish eating before we start this."

# game/scenario/6_1_0.rpy:177
translate english d61ea89e:

    # ryn fatigue "Ouais. Bien sûr. On va attendre bien gentiment l'heure prévue."
    ryn fatigue "Yeah. Sure. We'll sit tight and wait for the scheduled time like good little representatives."

# game/scenario/6_1_0.rpy:179
translate english fe0b3357:

    # sael mefiant "C'est mieux."
    sael mefiant "That would be best."

# game/scenario/6_1_0.rpy:181
translate english 21fdaad0:

    # ryn colere2 "Évidemment que pour toi, c'est mieux."
    ryn colere2 "Of course you'd think so."

# game/scenario/6_1_0.rpy:183
translate english da538a64:

    # noam determine "Ryn. Pas ici."
    noam determine "Ryn. Not here."

# game/scenario/6_1_0.rpy:187
translate english 7c2740d9:

    # ryn desaccord "J'ai compris."
    ryn desaccord "I get it."

# game/scenario/6_1_0.rpy:189
translate english 2f016d46:

    # think "Il repousse son plateau et se lève."
    think "He pushes his tray away and gets up."

# game/scenario/6_1_0.rpy:191
translate english 68cb8857:

    # ryn fatigue "J'ai plus faim."
    ryn fatigue "I'm not hungry anymore."

# game/scenario/6_1_0.rpy:195
translate english 37d687ae:

    # think "Ryn quitte la cafétéria sans regarder personne. Sael ne le suit pas des yeux."
    think "Ryn leaves the cafeteria without looking at anyone. Sael doesn't watch him go."

# game/scenario/6_1_0.rpy:196
translate english 1966a219:

    # think "La discussion reprend quelques instants plus tard, mais personne ne retrouve vraiment le ton léger d'Elen."
    think "The conversation picks up again a few moments later, but no one really recaptures Elen's lighthearted tone."

# game/scenario/6_1_0.rpy:200
translate english b79f6874:

    # think "La matinée s'étire. Nous avons encore quelques heures avant de nous retrouver dans la salle de repos."
    think "The morning drags on. We still have a few hours before we meet in the lounge."

# game/scenario/6_1_0.rpy:225
translate english 4a180cae:

    # think "Après mon temps libre, je rejoins plusieurs représentants dans la salle de repos."
    think "After my free time, I join several representatives in the lounge."

# game/scenario/6_1_0.rpy:226
translate english 4299ee49:

    # think "La télévision est éteinte. Elias et Sael terminent une partie de fléchettes pendant qu'Elen commente chaque lancer comme une compétition officielle."
    think "The TV is off. Elias and Sael are finishing a game of darts while Elen commentates on every throw like it's an official tournament."

# game/scenario/6_1_0.rpy:228
translate english c6a5c692:

    # elen joie "Et maintenant, Sael va tenter le centre ! Une pression immense ! Une foule en délire !"
    elen joie "And now, Sael is going for the bullseye! The pressure is immense! The crowd is going wild!"

# game/scenario/6_1_0.rpy:230
translate english 090ae267:

    # sael neutre "Il n'y a pas de foule."
    sael neutre "There is no crowd."

# game/scenario/6_1_0.rpy:232
translate english 4b3bc647:

    # elen taquin "Elle est dans ma tête. C'est une foule très exigeante."
    elen taquin "There is in my head. And it's a very demanding crowd."

# game/scenario/6_1_0.rpy:234
translate english 81867065:

    # elias sourire "Elle est surtout bruyante."
    elias sourire "More like a very loud one."

# game/scenario/6_1_0.rpy:236
translate english 92f1293f:

    # elen desaccord "Le public a le droit de s'exprimer. C'est la démocratie."
    elen desaccord "The audience has a right to be heard. That's democracy."

# game/scenario/6_1_0.rpy:238
translate english d9dee08b:

    # mara taquin "Profites-en. Dans quelques heures, Kami risque de demander une autorisation pour les commentaires sportifs."
    mara taquin "Enjoy it while it lasts. In a few hours, Kami might start requiring permits for sports commentary."

# game/scenario/6_1_0.rpy:240
translate english 1ddca2d0:

    # sael reflechit "Le centre n'est pas toujours la meilleure cible."
    sael reflechit "The center isn't always the best target."

# game/scenario/6_1_0.rpy:242
translate english 8b59adfb:

    # elias ecoute "Si tu veux gagner, si."
    elias ecoute "It is if you want to win."

# game/scenario/6_1_0.rpy:244
translate english c67ca14f:

    # sael raison "Si je vise le centre et que je manque, je perds tout. Si je vise une zone plus large, je garde des points."
    sael raison "If I aim for the center and miss, I lose everything. If I aim for a wider section, I still score points."

# game/scenario/6_1_0.rpy:246
translate english 56b8b84f:

    # julian sourire "Je ne sais pas si elle parle encore des fléchettes."
    julian sourire "I'm not sure she's talking about darts anymore."

# game/scenario/6_1_0.rpy:248
translate english 236800a7:

    # lysa blase "Elle ne parle plus des fléchettes depuis le début."
    lysa blase "She hasn't been talking about darts from the start."

# game/scenario/6_1_0.rpy:252
translate english 979315f3:

    # think "Sael lance. La fléchette se plante loin du centre, mais dans une zone encore correcte."
    think "Sael throws. The dart lands far from the bullseye, but still in a decent scoring section."

# game/scenario/6_1_0.rpy:254
translate english 39952525:

    # elias content "Tu joues vraiment comme ça ? Toujours le choix le moins risqué ?"
    elias content "Is that really how you play? Always taking the safest option?"

# game/scenario/6_1_0.rpy:256
translate english 33ce03ee:

    # sael neutre "Toujours le choix qui permet de rentrer vivant."
    sael neutre "Always taking the option that gets me home alive."

# game/scenario/6_1_0.rpy:260
translate english f3f44952:

    # think "Personne ne répond. La phrase pourrait ouvrir la discussion que nous évitons depuis ce matin."
    think "No one answers. That sentence could start the conversation we've been avoiding all morning."

# game/scenario/6_1_0.rpy:261
translate english 8a78d5b4:

    # think "Elias récupère les fléchettes sans insister."
    think "Elias retrieves the darts without pressing her."

# game/scenario/6_1_0.rpy:263
translate english 0c8c407d:

    # iris fatigue "On s'est tous fait à l'idée, non ?"
    iris fatigue "We've all accepted it by now, haven't we?"

# game/scenario/6_1_0.rpy:265
translate english 5d735d25:

    # noam hesitation "À quelle idée ?"
    noam hesitation "Accepted what?"

# game/scenario/6_1_0.rpy:267
translate english 0a82025b:

    # iris triste "Ne m'oblige pas à la formuler."
    iris triste "Don't make me say it out loud."

# game/scenario/6_1_0.rpy:269
translate english fa7cef0e:

    # kael calme "Le vote ne passera pas."
    kael calme "The proposal won't pass."

# game/scenario/6_1_0.rpy:273
translate english a44dc1b1:

    # think "Voilà. C'est dit. Personne ne proteste."
    think "There. It's been said. No one objects."

# game/scenario/6_1_0.rpy:275
translate english 1f2de534:

    # mara neutre "Sael a été claire dès l'annonce. On peut débattre jusqu'à demain matin, ça ne changera rien."
    mara neutre "Sael made herself clear from the moment it was announced. We could debate until tomorrow morning and it wouldn't change a thing."

# game/scenario/6_1_0.rpy:277
translate english 49ced268:

    # elen triste "C'est quand même nul."
    elen triste "It still sucks."

# game/scenario/6_1_0.rpy:279
translate english f16327b1:

    # lysa blase "Analyse politique remarquable."
    lysa blase "Remarkable political analysis."

# game/scenario/6_1_0.rpy:281
translate english b541e8bc:

    # elen desaccord "Je suis sérieuse. On vient de réussir à changer quelque chose et maintenant on sait déjà que la suite va échouer."
    elen desaccord "I'm serious. We just managed to change something, and now we already know the next proposal is going to fail."

# game/scenario/6_1_0.rpy:285
translate english 88288aee:

    # sael fatigue "Vous pouvez parler devant moi."
    sael fatigue "You can talk in front of me."

# game/scenario/6_1_0.rpy:287
translate english fad3db3c:

    # iris inquiet "Personne n'essaye de t'isoler, hein."
    iris inquiet "No one's trying to shut you out, okay?"

# game/scenario/6_1_0.rpy:289
translate english d6246664:

    # sael mefiant "Vous évitez le sujet depuis ce matin. Ce n'est pas de la délicatesse. C'est de la peur."
    sael mefiant "You've been avoiding the subject all morning. That's not tact. It's fear."

# game/scenario/6_1_0.rpy:291
translate english c5e077c2:

    # elias inquiet "On veut juste éviter que ça parte en vrille."
    elias inquiet "We're just trying to keep things from blowing up."

# game/scenario/6_1_0.rpy:293
translate english 5169d657:

    # sael neutre "Alors n'en parlez pas. Mais ne faites pas semblant de me protéger."
    sael neutre "Then don't talk about it. But don't pretend you're protecting me."

# game/scenario/6_1_0.rpy:297
translate english 81251e41:

    # think "Elle pose les fléchettes sur la table. Sa voix reste calme, mais la fatigue se lit dans son regard."
    think "She places the darts on the table. Her voice stays calm, but the exhaustion shows in her eyes."

# game/scenario/6_1_0.rpy:299
translate english f5ef7c6c:

    # noam neutre "Tu comptes rester ici jusqu'au débat ?"
    noam neutre "Are you staying here until the debate?"

# game/scenario/6_1_0.rpy:301
translate english 9819039b:

    # sael raison "Non. J'ai besoin de marcher."
    sael raison "No. I need to walk."

# game/scenario/6_1_0.rpy:303
translate english 777ee47a:

    # elen inquiet "Tu veux que quelqu'un vienne avec toi ?"
    elen inquiet "Want someone to come with you?"

# game/scenario/6_1_0.rpy:305
translate english 35872428:

    # sael sourire "Non. Merci."
    sael sourire "No. Thank you."

# game/scenario/6_1_0.rpy:307
translate english f9eba0ef:

    # think "Sael quitte la salle de repos."
    think "Sael leaves the lounge."

# game/scenario/6_1_0.rpy:312
translate english acf636e7:

    # julian triste "Vous pensez que Ryn va la laisser tranquille ?"
    julian triste "Do you think Ryn will leave her alone?"

# game/scenario/6_1_0.rpy:314
translate english febb44be:

    # mara mefiant "Non."
    mara mefiant "No."

# game/scenario/6_1_0.rpy:316
translate english eb83f377:

    # noam determine "Je vais vérifier."
    noam determine "I'll go check."

# game/scenario/6_1_0.rpy:318
translate english 45119785:

    # iris inquiet "Noam, attends. Il est à cran depuis ce matin."
    iris inquiet "Noam, wait. He's been on edge all morning."

# game/scenario/6_1_0.rpy:320
translate english e7b89fd1:

    # noam neutre "Justement."
    noam neutre "Exactly."

# game/scenario/6_1_0.rpy:322
translate english f270f260:

    # lysa inquiet "Ne joue pas au héros. S'ils veulent parler, laisse-les parler. Tu interviens seulement si ça dégénère."
    lysa inquiet "Don't play the hero. If they want to talk, let them talk. Only step in if things get out of hand."

# game/scenario/6_1_0.rpy:324
translate english 595c2af3:

    # noam determine "C'est ce que je compte faire."
    noam determine "That's the plan."

# game/scenario/6_1_0.rpy:344
translate english e6021772:

    # think "Je les retrouve dans le dortoir, à quelques mètres de la porte de Sael."
    think "I find them in the dormitory, a few feet from Sael's door."

# game/scenario/6_1_0.rpy:345
translate english 80cd4e59:

    # think "Ryn lui barre le passage. Sael garde les bras le long du corps, immobile."
    think "Ryn is blocking her path. Sael stands perfectly still, her arms at her sides."

# game/scenario/6_1_0.rpy:347
translate english a9f4a531:

    # ryn colere "Tu vas vraiment faire ça ?"
    ryn colere "You're really going to do this?"

# game/scenario/6_1_0.rpy:349
translate english 9eff8d95:

    # sael neutre "Je te l'ai déjà dit."
    sael neutre "I've already told you."

# game/scenario/6_1_0.rpy:351
translate english 7f45a6cf:

    # ryn colere2 "Non. Tu l'as dit aux autres. Comme une putain d'annonce. Moi, tu m'as rien expliqué."
    ryn colere2 "No. You told the others. Like some fucking announcement. You never explained anything to me."

# game/scenario/6_1_0.rpy:353
translate english 6c802348:

    # sael mefiant "Tu ne veux pas d'explication. Tu veux que je change d'avis."
    sael mefiant "You don't want an explanation. You want me to change my mind."

# game/scenario/6_1_0.rpy:355
translate english ee732555:

    # ryn desaccord "Évidemment que je veux que tu changes d'avis !"
    ryn desaccord "Of course I want you to change your mind!"

# game/scenario/6_1_0.rpy:357
translate english 9ae142ea:

    # sael raison "Alors cette conversation ne sert à rien."
    sael raison "Then this conversation is pointless."

# game/scenario/6_1_0.rpy:362
translate english 1c814a55:

    # ryn colere "Cette proposition, c'est moi qui l'ai déposée."
    ryn colere "I'm the one who put this proposal forward."

# game/scenario/6_1_0.rpy:366
translate english ff2b3891:

    # think "Sael ne répond pas. Son expression change à peine, mais ses épaules se tendent."
    think "Sael doesn't answer. Her expression barely changes, but her shoulders tense."

# game/scenario/6_1_0.rpy:368
translate english 4d8a1d9a:

    # ryn determine "C'est moi qui ai demandé qu'on puisse traverser les frontières. Pas Tomas. Pas Noam. Moi."
    ryn determine "I'm the one who asked for people to be allowed across the borders. Not Tomas. Not Noam. Me."

# game/scenario/6_1_0.rpy:369
translate english 7e943b0d:

    # ryn colere "J'ai passé des années à regarder les gens crever à quelques mètres d'une limite qu'ils pouvaient même pas voir."
    ryn colere "I spent years watching people die a few feet from a line they couldn't even see."

# game/scenario/6_1_0.rpy:370
translate english dfaebd96:

    # ryn colere2 "J'ai creusé des tranchées pour les empêcher d'avancer. J'ai ramené ceux qui avaient encore assez de jambes pour revenir."
    ryn colere2 "I dug trenches to stop them from moving forward. I carried back the ones who still had enough of their legs left to make it."

# game/scenario/6_1_0.rpy:371
translate english 7cf45216:

    # ryn colere "Et maintenant qu'on a enfin une chance d'ouvrir cette saloperie de frontière, c'est toi qui vas tout bloquer."
    ryn colere "And now that we finally have a chance to open that fucking border, you're the one who's going to block it."

# game/scenario/6_1_0.rpy:373
translate english c8c53f36:

    # sael fatigue "Oui."
    sael fatigue "Yes."

# game/scenario/6_1_0.rpy:375
translate english f2f2cf3b:

    # ryn surpris "C'est tout ?"
    ryn surpris "That's it?"

# game/scenario/6_1_0.rpy:377
translate english 3541d8b0:

    # sael neutre "Tu savais déjà que la proposition venait de toi. Moi, non. Ça ne change pas ce qu'elle fera à Limen."
    sael neutre "You already knew the proposal came from you. I didn't. It doesn't change what it'll do to Limen."

# game/scenario/6_1_0.rpy:379
translate english 93f46a9d:

    # ryn colere2 "Elle donnera une porte de sortie !"
    ryn colere2 "It'll give them a way out!"

# game/scenario/6_1_0.rpy:381
translate english 31764cf6:

    # sael determine "Aux plus forts. Aux plus jeunes. À ceux que les autres districts accepteront d'utiliser."
    sael determine "The strongest. The youngest. The ones the other districts can find a use for."

# game/scenario/6_1_0.rpy:382
translate english 16a27490:

    # sael raison "Les malades resteront. Les vieux resteront. Les enfants dont personne ne veut resteront."
    sael raison "The sick will stay. The old will stay. The children no one wants will stay."

# game/scenario/6_1_0.rpy:383
translate english fc64ad2d:

    # sael mefiant "Tu n'ouvres pas Limen. Tu le vides de tous ceux qui peuvent encore le tenir debout."
    sael mefiant "You're not opening Limen. You're draining it of everyone who can still keep it standing."

# game/scenario/6_1_0.rpy:385
translate english 4f76e9d1:

    # ryn desaccord "Tu décides à leur place."
    ryn desaccord "You're deciding for them."

# game/scenario/6_1_0.rpy:387
translate english ce9a00ef:

    # sael determine "Et toi, tu décides qu'ils survivront au passage parce que ça t'arrange d'y croire."
    sael determine "And you're deciding they'll survive the journey because it suits you to believe they will."

# game/scenario/6_1_0.rpy:391
translate english 0ed3f702:

    # ryn colere "Faut voter pour."
    ryn colere "You have to vote for it."

# game/scenario/6_1_0.rpy:393
translate english ff85f70c:

    # sael neutre "Non."
    sael neutre "No."

# game/scenario/6_1_0.rpy:395
translate english 9d2472b7:

    # ryn colere2 "Faut voter pour, Sael. Je te le demanderai pas une troisième fois."
    ryn colere2 "You have to vote for it, Sael. I'm not asking a third time."

# game/scenario/6_1_0.rpy:397
translate english 6cdba226:

    # sael mefiant "C'est une menace ?"
    sael mefiant "Is that a threat?"

# game/scenario/6_1_0.rpy:399
translate english f5403423:

    # ryn determine "Appelle ça comme tu veux. Si tu détruis cette chance, tout Limen saura qui l'a fait."
    ryn determine "Call it whatever you want. If you destroy this chance, all of Limen will know who did it."

# game/scenario/6_1_0.rpy:400
translate english 36e5fe1e:

    # ryn colere "Je dirai ton nom. Je dirai que t'as regardé la porte s'ouvrir et que tu l'as refermée sur eux."
    ryn colere "I'll tell them your name. I'll tell them you watched the door open, then slammed it shut on them."

# game/scenario/6_1_0.rpy:402
translate english ccc27030:

    # sael determine "Dis-le."
    sael determine "Tell them."

# game/scenario/6_1_0.rpy:404
translate english 489eb934:

    # ryn surpris "Quoi ?"
    ryn surpris "What?"

# game/scenario/6_1_0.rpy:406
translate english 69201812:

    # sael determine "Dis mon nom. Dis-leur aussi le tien quand les premiers corps seront abandonnés dans les districts qui n'en veulent pas."
    sael determine "Tell them my name. And tell them yours when the first bodies are abandoned in districts that don't want them."

# game/scenario/6_1_0.rpy:408
translate english 21f35ddb:

    # ryn colere2 "Ferme-la."
    ryn colere2 "Shut the fuck up."

# game/scenario/6_1_0.rpy:418
translate english bb3fb5bd:

    # noam determine "Ça suffit."
    noam determine "That's enough."

# game/scenario/6_1_0.rpy:422
translate english e5909b51:

    # think "Je m'avance entre eux. Ryn tourne brusquement la tête vers moi."
    think "I step between them. Ryn jerks his head toward me."

# game/scenario/6_1_0.rpy:424
translate english 4ccff7eb:

    # noam inquiet "Tu lui as dit ce que tu avais à dire. Maintenant, laisse-la passer."
    noam inquiet "You've said what you had to say. Now let her through."

# game/scenario/6_1_0.rpy:426
translate english 18556cc5:

    # ryn colere "Dégage, Noam."
    ryn colere "Get out of the way, Noam."

# game/scenario/6_1_0.rpy:428
translate english 8ae6ab13:

    # noam determine "Non."
    noam determine "No."

# game/scenario/6_1_0.rpy:430
translate english 7dc345da:

    # ryn desaccord "Ça te regarde pas."
    ryn desaccord "This has nothing to do with you."

# game/scenario/6_1_0.rpy:432
translate english d7930fed:

    # noam raison "On va tous voter. Ça nous regarde tous."
    noam raison "We're all voting. It has everything to do with all of us."

# game/scenario/6_1_0.rpy:434
translate english 2863222c:

    # ryn colere2 "Vous avez déjà abandonné ! Depuis ce matin, vous mangez, vous jouez, vous attendez que ça tombe !"
    ryn colere2 "You've already given up! All morning, you've been eating, playing games, waiting for it to fail!"

# game/scenario/6_1_0.rpy:436
translate english 6896bc44:

    # noam determine "Et la menacer va changer son vote ?"
    noam determine "And threatening her is going to change her vote?"

# game/scenario/6_1_0.rpy:438
translate english 7d88c0f2:

    # ryn colere "Au moins, je fais quelque chose !"
    ryn colere "At least I'm doing something!"

# game/scenario/6_1_0.rpy:440
translate english 4833c02b:

    # noam colere "Tu lui bloques le passage et tu lui cries dessus. Tu ne fais rien pour les habitants de Limen."
    noam colere "You're blocking her path and screaming at her. You're not doing anything for the people of Limen."

# game/scenario/6_1_0.rpy:444
translate english 28db9e71:

    # ryn colere2 "Écarte-toi."
    ryn colere2 "Move."

# game/scenario/6_1_0.rpy:446
translate english d8897566:

    # noam determine "Laisse-la partir."
    noam determine "Let her go."

# game/scenario/6_1_0.rpy:448
translate english f8015837:

    # think "Ryn pose une main sur mon épaule et me pousse. Je recule d'un pas, puis reviens immédiatement devant lui."
    think "Ryn puts a hand on my shoulder and shoves me. I stumble back a step, then immediately move in front of him again."

# game/scenario/6_1_0.rpy:450
translate english eee73690:

    # noam colere "Tu ne la toucheras pas."
    noam colere "You're not touching her."

# game/scenario/6_1_0.rpy:452
translate english 3522ebc1:

    # ryn colere2 "J'ai dit : écarte-toi !"
    ryn colere2 "I said move!"

# game/scenario/6_1_0.rpy:454
translate english 733e3d9c:

    # think "Son poing part avant que j'aie le temps de bouger."
    think "His fist comes at me before I have time to move."

# game/scenario/6_1_0.rpy:463
translate english f4fbaccd:

    # think "Le coup me frappe en plein visage. Ma tête part sur le côté et ma mâchoire explose de douleur."
    think "The punch catches me square in the face. My head snaps to the side, and pain explodes through my jaw."

# game/scenario/6_1_0.rpy:464
translate english 09c4294b:

    # think "Je heurte le mur avec l'épaule. Un goût métallique envahit ma bouche."
    think "My shoulder slams into the wall. A metallic taste floods my mouth."

# game/scenario/6_1_0.rpy:470
translate english e423d18d:

    # noam peur "Putain..."
    noam peur "Fuck..."

# game/scenario/6_1_0.rpy:472
translate english 96ba5f64:

    # sael peur "Noam !"
    sael peur "Noam!"

# game/scenario/6_1_0.rpy:474
translate english 026d8b6d:

    # ryn surpris "Merde."
    ryn surpris "Shit."

# game/scenario/6_1_0.rpy:478
translate english 9a1bf783:

    # think "Ryn fixe son poing comme s'il ne le reconnaissait plus."
    think "Ryn stares at his fist like he doesn't recognize it."

# game/scenario/6_1_0.rpy:480
translate english 6be01d67:

    # ryn inquiet "Je voulais... que tu bouges."
    ryn inquiet "I just wanted... you to move."

# game/scenario/6_1_0.rpy:482
translate english 392f8a29:

    # noam desaccord "En me frappant ?"
    noam desaccord "By punching me?"

# game/scenario/6_1_0.rpy:484
translate english e539fe48:

    # ryn fatigue "Putain ! J'en sais rien !"
    ryn fatigue "Fuck! I don't know!"

# game/scenario/6_1_0.rpy:488
translate english 337cc5f9:

    # sael determine "C'est terminé."
    sael determine "This is over."

# game/scenario/6_1_0.rpy:490
translate english 05f9d1c7_1:

    # ryn inquiet "Sael..."
    ryn inquiet "Sael..."

# game/scenario/6_1_0.rpy:492
translate english 6a3ed752:

    # sael desaccord "Non. Tu voulais que je t'écoute. Je t'ai écouté. Maintenant, tu vas t'écarter."
    sael desaccord "No. You wanted me to listen. I did. Now you're going to step aside."

# game/scenario/6_1_0.rpy:494
translate english 24e6cef6:

    # think "Ryn baisse les bras et recule. Sael s'approche de moi."
    think "Ryn lowers his arms and steps back. Sael comes over to me."

# game/scenario/6_1_0.rpy:496
translate english aa19859a:

    # sael inquiet "Laisse-moi voir."
    sael inquiet "Let me see."

# game/scenario/6_1_0.rpy:498
translate english ce409403:

    # noam inquiet "Ça va."
    noam inquiet "I'm fine."

# game/scenario/6_1_0.rpy:500
translate english 9f5d0810:

    # ryn colere "Putain..."
    ryn colere "Fuck..."

# game/scenario/6_1_0.rpy:502
translate english 3d00d3af:

    # sael desaccord "Non. Ta lèvre est ouverte. Tu vas avoir un sacré bleu."
    sael desaccord "No. Your lip is split. You're going to have one hell of a bruise."

# game/scenario/6_1_0.rpy:504
translate english 15e9b051:

    # noam colere "C'est pas ça qui me tuera, ça va aller."
    noam colere "It won't kill me. I'll be fine."

# game/scenario/6_1_0.rpy:508
translate english 332c217b:

    # think "Des pas résonnent dans le couloir. Iris, Elias et Lysa arrivent depuis la salle de repos."
    think "Footsteps echo down the corridor. Iris, Elias, and Lysa arrive from the lounge."

# game/scenario/6_1_0.rpy:519
translate english 4a5e6d1a:

    # iris colere "Qu'est-ce qui s'est passé ?"
    iris colere "What happened?"

# game/scenario/6_1_0.rpy:521
translate english 6960bc77:

    # lysa inquiet "Son visage répond déjà en partie à la question."
    lysa inquiet "His face already answers part of that question."

# game/scenario/6_1_0.rpy:523
translate english 698f4e30:

    # elias colere "Ryn. Dis-moi que c'est pas toi."
    elias colere "Ryn. Tell me that wasn't you."

# game/scenario/6_1_0.rpy:525
translate english 461a0e04:

    # ryn fatigue "Foutez-moi la paix !"
    ryn fatigue "Just leave me the fuck alone!"

# game/scenario/6_1_0.rpy:529
translate english 7932f694:

    # iris colere "Mais t'es complètement malade ?!"
    iris colere "What the hell is wrong with you?!"

# game/scenario/6_1_0.rpy:531
translate english 9da79d30:

    # sael determine "Nous devons aller au Conclave. Le débat va commencer d'une minute à l'autre."
    sael determine "We need to go to the Conclave. The debate is about to begin."

# game/scenario/6_1_0.rpy:533
translate english 2e4015e8:

    # iris desaccord "Noam doit d'abord passer à l'infirmerie."
    iris desaccord "Noam needs to go to the infirmary first."

# game/scenario/6_1_0.rpy:535
translate english 13f1f260:

    # noam inquiet "On n'a pas le temps. Et je peux marcher, c'est trois fois rien."
    noam inquiet "We don't have time. I can walk—it's nothing."

# game/scenario/6_1_0.rpy:537
translate english d29ca4b6:

    # iris colere "C'est pas parce que tu peux marcher que tout va bien."
    iris colere "Just because you can walk doesn't mean you're fine."

# game/scenario/6_1_0.rpy:539
translate english c8f3960b:

    # noam determine "Je vais assister au vote."
    noam determine "I'm going to the vote."

# game/scenario/6_1_0.rpy:541
translate english f49f689e:

    # lysa blase "Évidemment. Sinon cette journée risquerait de devenir raisonnable."
    lysa blase "Of course you are. Otherwise, this day might almost start making sense."

# game/scenario/6_1_0.rpy:547
translate english f3c4ee80:

    # think "Nous partons vers la salle du Conclave. Chaque mouvement de ma mâchoire relance la douleur."
    think "We head for the Conclave chamber. Every movement of my jaw sends another jolt of pain through it."

# game/scenario/6_1_0.rpy:574
translate english 2873093b:

    # think "À peine entrés, tous les regards se posent sur ma lèvre fendue et sur la marque qui commence à apparaître sur ma joue."
    think "The moment we enter, everyone's eyes land on my split lip and the bruise beginning to form on my cheek."

# game/scenario/6_1_0.rpy:576
translate english ecdaa84f:

    # elen choque "Noam ?! Qu'est-ce qui t'est arrivé ?"
    elen choque "Noam?! What happened to you?"

# game/scenario/6_1_0.rpy:578
translate english 78d6a6f6:

    # mara colere "Attends. Pourquoi Ryn a du sang sur la main ?"
    mara colere "Wait. Why does Ryn have blood on his hand?"

# game/scenario/6_1_0.rpy:580
translate english 5a8f2b7b:

    # julian inquietude "Vous vous êtes battus ?"
    julian inquietude "Did you two fight?"

# game/scenario/6_1_0.rpy:582
translate english 9e2f4364:

    # noam inquiet "Ce n'était pas une bagarre."
    noam inquiet "It wasn't a fight."

# game/scenario/6_1_0.rpy:584
translate english f8691cea:

    # nyra degout "Effectivement. Pour une bagarre, il faudrait que les deux personnes aient frappé."
    nyra degout "Right. For it to be a fight, both people would have to throw a punch."

# game/scenario/6_1_0.rpy:586
translate english 823ff67b:

    # ryn triste "J'ai déconné."
    ryn triste "I fucked up."

# game/scenario/6_1_0.rpy:588
translate english a580f4b2:

    # mara colere_noire "Tu as frappé Noam avant un vote décisif et ton résumé, c'est que tu as déconné ?"
    mara colere_noire "You hit Noam right before a crucial vote, and your summary is that you fucked up?"

# game/scenario/6_1_0.rpy:590
translate english cc6c98f8:

    # elias colere "Il a menacé Sael aussi."
    elias colere "He threatened Sael too."

# game/scenario/6_1_0.rpy:592
translate english 62bb4cfe:

    # elen colere "Mais qu'est-ce qui te prend ?! On est tous tendus, ça te donne pas le droit de taper les gens !"
    elen colere "What the hell is wrong with you?! We're all on edge. That doesn't give you the right to hit people!"

# game/scenario/6_1_0.rpy:594
translate english 5ec22353:

    # ryn colere "Je sais ! Vous voulez que je dise quoi de plus ?"
    ryn colere "I know! What else do you want me to say?"

# game/scenario/6_1_0.rpy:596
translate english ff3d9a85:

    # iris colere "Commence par arrêter de gueuler comme si c'était encore nous le problème."
    iris colere "For a start, stop yelling like we're still the problem here."

# game/scenario/6_1_0.rpy:598
translate english 70bdeae8:

    # kael inquietude "Le vote était déjà compromis. Cette violence ne pouvait rien améliorer."
    kael inquietude "The vote was already in jeopardy. Violence could not have improved the situation."

# game/scenario/6_1_0.rpy:600
translate english ebc6d7a6:

    # ryn colere2 "Merci, Kael. Vraiment. J'avais besoin de ton analyse."
    ryn colere2 "Thanks, Kael. Really. I needed your analysis."

# game/scenario/6_1_0.rpy:602
translate english cc80f42d:

    # nyra colere "Tu recommences."
    nyra colere "You're doing it again."

# game/scenario/6_1_0.rpy:604
translate english ccc1b97a:

    # tomas inquiet "On devrait peut-être... enfin... laisser Noam s'asseoir avant de continuer."
    tomas inquiet "Maybe we should... um... let Noam sit down before we keep going."

# game/scenario/6_1_0.rpy:606
translate english 759ddc16:

    # lysa opposition "On devrait surtout arrêter cette séance avant que quelqu'un décide de terminer le travail."
    lysa opposition "What we should do is end this session before someone decides to finish the job."

# game/scenario/6_1_0.rpy:608
translate english 992e426d:

    # noam determine "Ça suffit. Je vais bien."
    noam determine "Enough. I'm fine."

# game/scenario/6_1_0.rpy:610
translate english 90a97f31:

    # iris desaccord "Non, tu ne vas pas bien."
    iris desaccord "No, you're not."

# game/scenario/6_1_0.rpy:612
translate english 7e3fe9ef:

    # noam inquiet "Je peux voter. C'est ce qui compte pour le moment."
    noam inquiet "I can vote. That's what matters right now."

# game/scenario/6_1_0.rpy:616
translate english e060b7a5:

    # think "Ryn garde les yeux baissés. Sael regarde la salle, puis le siège vide devant elle."
    think "Ryn keeps his eyes lowered. Sael looks around the room, then at the empty seat in front of her."

# game/scenario/6_1_0.rpy:618
translate english 0214f5d2:

    # sael determine "Je vote contre. J'assume mes choix."
    sael determine "I'm voting against it. I stand by my choices."

# game/scenario/6_1_0.rpy:620
translate english 2e0dd9d6:

    # "Sael nous regarde tous droit dans les yeux."
    "Sael looks every one of us straight in the eye."

# game/scenario/6_1_0.rpy:626
translate english 0efcbc27:

    # think "Le silence tombe d'un seul coup."
    think "The room falls silent all at once."

# game/scenario/6_1_0.rpy:628
translate english 90617c5d:

    # noam surpris "Sael..."
    noam surpris "Sael..."

# game/scenario/6_1_0.rpy:630
translate english e661f47a:

    # sael neutre "Le débat est terminé. Une voix contre suffit. Il n'y a plus rien à obtenir ici."
    sael neutre "The debate is over. One vote against is enough. There's nothing left to gain here."

# game/scenario/6_1_0.rpy:632
translate english 7cc77225:

    # ryn inquiet "Tu fais ça à cause de moi ?"
    ryn inquiet "Are you doing this because of me?"

# game/scenario/6_1_0.rpy:634
translate english f51e1247:

    # sael triste "Ma décision était prise avant aujourd'hui."
    sael triste "I made my decision before today."

# game/scenario/6_1_0.rpy:638
translate english f52ff4e7:

    # sael determine "Ne lui en voulez pas. Ryn a juste voulu faire de son mieux. Si vous avez quelqu'un à qui vous en prendre, c'est moi."
    sael determine "Don't blame him. Ryn was just trying to do his best. If you need someone to blame, blame me."

# game/scenario/6_1_0.rpy:640
translate english 63abe1b5:

    # noam desaccord "Tu n'es pas responsable de ce qu'il a fait."
    noam desaccord "You're not responsible for what he did."

# game/scenario/6_1_0.rpy:642
translate english 4653fd41:

    # sael fatigue "Je sais."
    sael fatigue "I know."

# game/scenario/6_1_0.rpy:644
translate english 772225b2:

    # think "Sael valide son vote sur le terminal, puis quitte son siège."
    think "Sael confirms her vote on the terminal, then leaves her seat."

# game/scenario/6_1_0.rpy:646
translate english 051af713:

    # sael neutre "Je n'ai plus rien à dire."
    sael neutre "I have nothing more to say."

# game/scenario/6_1_0.rpy:650
translate english e5b54343:

    # think "La porte se referme derrière elle. Le vote est déjà perdu."
    think "The door closes behind her. The vote is already lost."

# game/scenario/6_1_0.rpy:659
translate english 0d202e0a:

    # kami "Quoi ?! C'est tout ?!"
    kami "What?! That's it?!"

# game/scenario/6_1_0.rpy:663
translate english dd916e5c:

    # kami "Une menace, un coup au visage, une salle entière prête à s'étriper... et vous interrompez déjà le débat ?"
    kami "A threat, a punch to the face, a room full of people ready to tear each other apart... and you're ending the debate already?"

# game/scenario/6_1_0.rpy:664
translate english 331eb4de:

    # kami "J'avais préparé plusieurs angles de caméra. J'espérais des arguments, des larmes, peut-être même une seconde droite !"
    kami "I had several camera angles set up. I was hoping for arguments, tears, maybe even a second right hook!"

# game/scenario/6_1_0.rpy:668
translate english bc5d4658:

    # kami "Vous pourriez faire un effort ! La démocratie mérite de meilleurs débats que cette catastrophe expédiée en quelques minutes."
    kami "You could at least make an effort! Democracy deserves better debates than this disaster you rushed through in a matter of minutes."

# game/scenario/6_1_0.rpy:672
translate english 96055b9a:

    # kami "Mais soit. Une représentante s'est exprimée. La démocratie a parlé !"
    kami "But fine. One representative has spoken. Democracy has spoken!"

# game/scenario/6_1_0.rpy:673
translate english 8c50cc0d:

    # kami "Son vote contre condamne déjà la proposition, mais les autres représentants doivent encore enregistrer leur choix."
    kami "Her vote against has already doomed the proposal, but the other representatives must still record their choices."

# game/scenario/6_1_0.rpy:674
translate english 44563a5b:

    # kami "Allez. Faites au moins semblant de prendre cette partie au sérieux."
    kami "Go on. At least pretend you're taking this part seriously."

# game/scenario/6_1_0.rpy:682
translate english 99491448:

    # think "Mon terminal s'allume. Le résultat est déjà décidé, mais mon vote m'appartient encore."
    think "My terminal lights up. The outcome has already been decided, but my vote is still mine."

# game/scenario/6_1_0.rpy:698
translate english b0ebc3f5:

    # noam determine "Je vote pour."
    noam determine "I vote in favor."

# game/scenario/6_1_0.rpy:703
translate english eb88e9ea:

    # noam raison "Je vote contre."
    noam raison "I vote against."

# game/scenario/6_1_0.rpy:708
translate english 2be7bab3:

    # noam hesitation "Je m'abstiens."
    noam hesitation "I abstain."

# game/scenario/6_1_0.rpy:743
translate english 255b8ac9:

    # kami "Résultat définitif : huit voix pour, deux abstentions et deux voix contre."
    kami "Final result: eight votes in favor, two abstentions, and two votes against."

# game/scenario/6_1_0.rpy:745
translate english e2078cc8:

    # kami "Deux refus ! Sael n'était donc pas la seule à vouloir refermer la porte. Comme c'est intéressant."
    kami "Two rejections! So Sael wasn't the only one who wanted to close the door again. How interesting."

# game/scenario/6_1_0.rpy:747
translate english baf6abce:

    # kami "Résultat définitif : huit voix pour, trois abstentions et une voix contre."
    kami "Final result: eight votes in favor, three abstentions, and one vote against."

# game/scenario/6_1_0.rpy:749
translate english 457df45d:

    # kami "Une seule voix contre. Une toute petite voix, et pourtant des frontières bien solides."
    kami "Just one vote against. One tiny little vote, and yet such solid borders."

# game/scenario/6_1_0.rpy:751
translate english 6051d68a:

    # kami "Résultat définitif : neuf voix pour, deux abstentions et une voix contre."
    kami "Final result: nine votes in favor, two abstentions, and one vote against."

# game/scenario/6_1_0.rpy:753
translate english 86c24db1:

    # kami "Neuf voix favorables contre une seule opposition. Presque une victoire... ce qui signifie exactement un échec."
    kami "Nine votes in favor against a single opposing vote. Almost a victory... which means it was, quite precisely, a failure."

# game/scenario/6_1_0.rpy:757
translate english 09505d2a:

    # kami "La proposition est rejetée. Les déplacements entre les districts restent soumis à une autorisation stricte."
    kami "The proposal is rejected. Travel between districts will remain subject to strict authorization."

# game/scenario/6_1_0.rpy:758
translate english 11f3e2c1:

    # kami "Les marchandises continueront de circuler. Les habitants, eux, resteront gentiment à leur place."
    kami "Goods will continue to move freely. The residents, meanwhile, will stay nicely in their place."

# game/scenario/6_1_0.rpy:762
translate english 9fe790c7:

    # kami "Félicitations pour cette magnifique démonstration démocratique ! Essayez seulement de ne pas vous frapper avant le prochain vote."
    kami "Congratulations on this magnificent display of democracy! Just try not to hit each other before the next vote."

# game/scenario/6_1_0.rpy:775
translate english 7d7e4bf3:

    # think "Je retourne vers ma chambre. Ma lèvre me brûle et ma mâchoire lance à chacun de mes pas."
    think "I head back to my room. My lip burns, and pain throbs through my jaw with every step."

# game/scenario/6_1_0.rpy:776
translate english bc9c9f75:

    # think "Les marchandises pourront franchir les frontières. Les personnes, non."
    think "Goods will be allowed to cross the borders. People won't."

# game/scenario/6_1_0.rpy:777
translate english 5a208b69:

    # think "Ryn a frappé pour ouvrir une porte. Sael l'a refermée pour empêcher Limen de se vider."
    think "Ryn threw a punch to open a door. Sael closed it to keep Limen from being emptied out."

# game/scenario/6_1_0.rpy:778
translate english 43b31ba3:

    # think "Et moi, je ne sais même plus lequel des deux avait le plus peur."
    think "And I don't even know which of them was more afraid."

# game/scenario/6_1_0.rpy:782
translate english 84fbb120:

    # think "Demain matin, une nouvelle livraison doit atteindre le Conclave."
    think "A new delivery is due to reach the Conclave tomorrow morning."

# game/scenario/6_1_0.rpy:783
translate english 8e9d8597:

    # think "De la nourriture, des médicaments, du matériel. Rien qui soit censé respirer."
    think "Food, medicine, equipment. Nothing that's supposed to be breathing."

